# Node.js / Passenger (cPanel, CloudLinux)
# This file must exist so the host’s Node selector can start/stop the app without FileNotFoundError.
# If your app path differs from the folder that contains this file, set PassengerAppRoot explicitly
# (see cPanel → Setup Node.js Application → your app’s “Application URL” directory).

PassengerEnabled on
PassengerAppType node
PassengerStartupFile server.js
